 src=\"images/afro-cut.jpg\" alt=\"أفرو مشكّل مع تحديد\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade-side.jpg\" alt=\"لو فيد، من الجانب\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade-pair.jpg\" alt=\"فيدان جديدان\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chair.jpg\" alt=\"كرسي الحلاقة في Final Kuts\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">التقييمات</p><h2>ماذا يقول عملاؤنا</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">5.0</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 227 تقييم</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Final+Kuts+Barbershop/@38.3559069,-121.9891209,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d0d426bd07d:0x6bc0dff565469c5b!8m2!3d38.3559069!4d-121.9891209!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">اقرأ المزيد من التقييمات على Google ←</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Booksy</b> · 401 تقييم</div><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/384088_final-kuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">اقرأ المزيد من التقييمات على Booksy ←</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Best spot in town, hands down. No matter who you get, they&#39;re all great &amp; always take care of everyone that walks through the door. The atmosphere is lively &amp; the conversations are entertaining. I highly recommend everyone to check out Final Kuts.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Paul is professional, reliable and his shop is pleasant and very clean. He does an excellent job on my hair!!!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Andrea · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/196333_hollywood-the-barber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“My son doesn’t like getting haircuts and Patrick was very patient and understanding. The shop is clean and always good vibes when we visit.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great experience. My third time going in for a cut with Mare. Friendly, professional and attentive. I am very happy with the cut. Everyone in the shop is very friendly. Great place for a cut and shave. I recommend.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Rick · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1366045_marethebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Amare took our walk-in for my 1year old son’s mullet haircut and not only perfected exactly what I wanted, but also did it in a timely manner which is critically important when cutting a child’s hair! I’m very pleased! I think I’ve found my son’s barber!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great service Luis is an exceptional barber who pays attention to detail. I left feeling confident highly recommend”</blockquote><figcaption>— Peezy · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1711890_luis_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Andrew is an exceptional barber! He listened to what we needed and cut my son&#39;s hair perfectly- crisp and clean. The barbershop is friendly, comfortable professional and close to places to have a bite while you wait for someone.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Final%20Kuts%20Barbershop%20348%20Merchant%20St%20Ste%20A%20Vacaville%20CA%2095688\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Patrick is excellent! Super friendly and chill environment”</blockquote><figcaption>— Vincent · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593397_patrick_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“This is a great barber shop, friendly professional and great cuts. Great for walk ins..”</blockquote><figcaption>— Johnny C. · Yelp</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great atmosphere. My son got a regular hair cut from Paul. He was very attentive, asking questions to ensure he got what he wanted.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Arminthia S. · Yelp</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">الأسئلة الشائعة</p><h2>إجابات أسئلتكم</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>هل يمكنني الحضور بدون موعد؟</summary><p>نعم! نرحّب بالحضور بدون موعد، بل قصصنا شعر أطفال بعمر سنة واحدة دون حجز. ولتتجنب الانتظار، احجز حلاقك عبر الإنترنت.</p></details><details><summary>كيف أحجز مع حلاق معيّن؟</summary><p>لكل واحد منا صفحة حجز خاصة: Hollywood The Barber وPatrick وMarethebarber وLuis. فقط اضغط على أزرار الحجز في الأعلى.</p></details><details><summary>كم سعر قصّة الشعر؟</summary><p>القصّة الرجالية العادية من 40 إلى 45 دولارًا حسب الحلاق. اضغط زر الحجز الخاص بحلاقك لمعرفة الأسعار الحالية.</p></details><details><summary>هل تقصّون شعر الأطفال؟</summary><p>نعم! قصّات الأطفال من 35 إلى 50 دولارًا. Mare يستقبل الأطفال من 8 سنوات فأكثر، وقصّات Hollywood لمن هم دون 6 سنوات غير متاحة من الخميس إلى السبت.</p></details><details><summary>هل تقصّون خارج أوقات العمل؟</summary><p>نعم. Hollywood يقصّ خارج أوقات العمل من 70 دولارًا، وPatrick يقصّ قبل أو بعد أوقات العمل مقابل 70 دولارًا.</p></details><details><summary>هل تقبلون البطاقات؟</summary><p>Patrick يقبل بطاقات الائتمان. بالنسبة لبقية الحلاقين، اتصل بنا على ‎(707) 685-9136 للتأكد.</p></details><details><summary>ما هي مواعيد العمل؟</summary><p>نفتح الاثنين من 10 صباحًا حتى 6 مساءً، ومن الثلاثاء إلى الجمعة من 10 صباحًا حتى 7 مساءً، والسبت من 9 صباحًا حتى 6 مساءً، ونغلق يوم الأحد. قد تتغير المواعيد قليلًا، لذا احجز عبر الإنترنت أو اتصل.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">زورونا</p>\n      <h2>المواعيد والموقع</h2>\n      <address>348 Merchant St Ste A<br>Vacaville, CA 95688</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076859136\">(707) 685-9136</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>الاثنين</td><td>10 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>الثلاثاء</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>الأربعاء</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>الخميس</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>الجمعة</td><td>10 AM – 7 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>السبت</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>الأحد</td><td>مغلق</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">قد تتغير المواعيد قليلًا، لذا احجز عبر الإنترن